			<div class="content" id="post-content-4541108">
									

<p>I want to like this. The concept of a royal plant monster coming out of the sea with explosive farts and then getting upset about houseplants is hilarious, but I feel like this lacks in execution.</p>
<p>As it is currently written, the explosive farts feel like a tacked on attempt to make it fit to the theme. It isn't really used for anything except a few jokes, which I didn't find exceptionally funny, and the article wouldn't be worsened by the skip not having 'a condition'.</p>
<p>The biggest issue I have here though that the text could use a few more revisions. There are several sections that read kind of clumsily, the dialogue doesn't feel very realistic to me and there are several formatting errors throughout the piece, with names lacking bolding and spaces missing between lines.</p>
<p>If this saw a few more revisions and the text was cleaned up, I could see myself upvoting this, but as it currently stands I lean towards a downvote.</p>

